# packages/components is a SEPARATE pnpm workspace root (it has its own
# pnpm-workspace.yaml), so the repo-root .npmrc does NOT reach here — pnpm does
# not read .npmrc files above a workspace root.
#
# NOTE: pnpm 11 no longer reads `verify-deps-before-run` / `strict-dep-builds`
# (nor build-script approvals) from .npmrc — those keys resolve to `undefined`
# here (verify with `pnpm config get strict-dep-builds`). They now live in
# `pnpm-workspace.yaml` as `verifyDepsBeforeRun` / `strictDepBuilds` /
# `allowBuilds`, which is where the deps-status-check + ignored-builds
# mitigations actually take effect. Put pnpm-specific settings there, not here.
